{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 8,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 442.034,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that Alma returned from the land of Gideon,",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.267,
      "end": 8.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after having taught the people of Gideon many things which cannot be written,",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.859,
      "end": 11.553,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having established the order of the church,",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.733,
      "end": 15.077,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according as he had before done in the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.257,
      "end": 22.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he returned to his own house at Zarahemla to rest himself from the labors which he had performed.",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.949,
      "end": 27.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the ninth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 28.366,
      "end": 35.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the commencement of the tenth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 35.187,
      "end": 42.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Alma departed from thence and took his journey over into the land of Melek, on the west of the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 42.472,
      "end": 45.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "on the west by the borders of the wilderness.",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 46.356,
      "end": 51.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he began to teach the people in the land of Melek according to the holy order of God,",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 52.016,
      "end": 53.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by which he had been called;",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 54.1,
      "end": 58.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he began to teach the people throughout all the land of Melek.",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 59.099,
      "end": 62.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the people came to him",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 62.205,
      "end": 67.778,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "throughout all the borders of the land which was by the wilderness side.",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 67.958,
      "end": 70.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were baptized throughout all the land;",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 71.471,
      "end": 74.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "So that when he had finished his work at Melek",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 74.995,
      "end": 80.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he departed thence, and traveled three days' journey on the north of the land of Melek;",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 80.608,
      "end": 83.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he came to a city which was called Ammonihah.",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 84.353,
      "end": 91.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it was the custom of the people of Nephi to call their lands, and their cities, and their villages,",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 91.778,
      "end": 94.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even all their small villages,",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 94.466,
      "end": 97.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after the name of him who first possessed them;",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 97.665,
      "end": 100.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus it was with the land of Ammonihah.",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 100.992,
      "end": 105.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Alma had come to the city of Ammonihah",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 105.63,
      "end": 108.277,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he began to preach the word of God unto them.",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 108.957,
      "end": 114.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Satan had gotten great hold upon the hearts of the people of the city of Ammonihah;",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 114.71,
      "end": 118.239,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they would not hearken unto the words of Alma.",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 118.919,
      "end": 122.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless Alma labored much in the spirit,",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 122.303,
      "end": 124.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wrestling with God in mighty prayer,",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 124.898,
      "end": 127.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would pour out his Spirit",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 127.307,
      "end": 129.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon the people who were in the city;",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 129.716,
      "end": 134.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would also grant that he might baptize them unto repentance.",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 134.947,
      "end": 138.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, they hardened their hearts, saying unto him:",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 138.378,
      "end": 140.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we know that thou art Alma;",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 141.159,
      "end": 144.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we know that thou art high priest over the church",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 144.915,
      "end": 149.698,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which thou hast established in many parts of the land, according to your tradition;",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 149.878,
      "end": 152.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we are not of thy church,",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 152.194,
      "end": 155.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we do not believe in such foolish traditions.",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 156.311,
      "end": 159.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now we know that because we are not of thy church",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 159.742,
      "end": 162.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we know that thou hast no power over us;",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 162.708,
      "end": 166.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou hast delivered up the judgment-seat unto Nephihah;",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 166.417,
      "end": 169.482,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore thou art not the chief judge over us.",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 170.162,
      "end": 172.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when the people had said this,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 172.525,
      "end": 174.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and withstood all his words,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 174.655,
      "end": 176.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and reviled him,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 176.182,
      "end": 177.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and spit upon him,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 177.895,
      "end": 181.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and caused that he should be cast out of their city,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 181.883,
      "end": 186.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he departed thence and took his journey towards the city which was called Aaron.",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 186.975,
      "end": 191.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that while he was journeying thither, being weighed down with sorrow,",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 192.171,
      "end": 201.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wading through much tribulation and anguish of soul, because of the wickedness of the people who were in the city of Ammonihah,",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 201.453,
      "end": 205.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it came to pass while Alma was thus weighed down with sorrow,",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 205.627,
      "end": 208.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold an angel of the Lord appeared unto him, saying:",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 209.326,
      "end": 210.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Blessed art thou, Alma;",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 211.178,
      "end": 213.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, lift up thy head and rejoice,",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 213.959,
      "end": 216.188,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou hast great cause to rejoice;",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 216.368,
      "end": 224.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou hast been faithful in keeping the commandments of God from the time which thou receivedst thy first message from him.",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 224.768,
      "end": 227.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I am he that delivered it unto you.",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 228.002,
      "end": 232.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I am sent to command thee that thou return to the city of Ammonihah,",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 232.872,
      "end": 235.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and preach again unto the people of the city;",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 235.792,
      "end": 237.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, preach unto them.",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 237.365,
      "end": 238.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, say unto them,",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 239.124,
      "end": 241.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except they repent the Lord God will destroy them.",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 242.544,
      "end": 244.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, they do study at this time",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 245.092,
      "end": 248.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may destroy the liberty of thy people,",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 248.43,
      "end": 250.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(for thus saith the Lord)",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 250.421,
      "end": 256.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is contrary to the statutes, and judgments, and commandments which he has given unto his people.",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 257.37,
      "end": 262.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that after Alma had received his message from the angel of the Lord",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 262.937,
      "end": 265.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he returned speedily to the land of Ammonihah.",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 266.089,
      "end": 268.643,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he entered the city by another way,",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 268.823,
      "end": 272.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, by the way which is on the south of the city of Ammonihah.",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 272.847,
      "end": 275.773,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as he entered the city he was an hungered,",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 275.953,
      "end": 277.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he said to a man:",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 277.619,
      "end": 281.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Will ye give to an humble servant of God something to eat?",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 281.828,
      "end": 283.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the man said unto him:",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 283.633,
      "end": 285.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am a Nephite,",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 285.346,
      "end": 288.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I know that thou art a holy prophet of God,",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 288.452,
      "end": 291.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou art the man whom an angel said in a vision:",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 291.976,
      "end": 293.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt receive.",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 293.549,
      "end": 295.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, go with me into my house",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 295.912,
      "end": 298.327,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will impart unto thee of my food;",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 298.507,
      "end": 301.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I know that thou wilt be a blessing unto me and my house.",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 302.624,
      "end": 306.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the man received him into his house;",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 306.612,
      "end": 308.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the man was called Amulek;",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 308.975,
      "end": 312.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he brought forth bread and meat and set before Alma.",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 312.999,
      "end": 316.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Alma ate bread and was filled;",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 316.337,
      "end": 318.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he blessed Amulek and his house,",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 318.7,
      "end": 320.558,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he gave thanks unto God.",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 321.238,
      "end": 324.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after he had eaten and was filled he said unto Amulek:",
      "verse": "8:23",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 324.947,
      "end": 329.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am Alma, and am the high priest over the church of God throughout the land.",
      "verse": "8:23",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 330.317,
      "end": 338.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I have been called to preach the word of God among all this people, according to the spirit of revelation and prophecy;",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 339.088,
      "end": 340.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I was in this land",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 341.079,
      "end": 342.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they would not receive me,",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 343.024,
      "end": 344.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they cast me out",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 344.783,
      "end": 348.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I was about to set my back towards this land forever.",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 349.039,
      "end": 353.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I have been commanded that I should turn again",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 353.259,
      "end": 355.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prophesy unto this people,",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 355.575,
      "end": 359.708,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and to testify against them concerning their iniquities.",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 360.388,
      "end": 361.874,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, Amulek,",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 362.054,
      "end": 364.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because thou hast fed me and taken me in,",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 365.067,
      "end": 366.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou art blessed;",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 366.78,
      "end": 368.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I was an hungered,",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 368.771,
      "end": 370.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I had fasted many days.",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 371.216,
      "end": 376.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma tarried many days with Amulek before he began to preach unto the people.",
      "verse": "8:27",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 377.097,
      "end": 382.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the people did wax more gross in their iniquities.",
      "verse": "8:28",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 382.7,
      "end": 384.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the word came to Alma, saying:",
      "verse": "8:29",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 385.063,
      "end": 387.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Go; and also say unto my servant Amulek,",
      "verse": "8:29",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 387.937,
      "end": 390.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "go forth and prophesy unto this people, saying\u2014",
      "verse": "8:29",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 390.764,
      "end": 393.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Repent ye, for thus saith the Lord,",
      "verse": "8:29",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 393.452,
      "end": 396.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except ye repent I will visit this people in mine anger;",
      "verse": "8:29",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 396.929,
      "end": 400.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I will not turn my fierce anger away.",
      "verse": "8:29",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 400.813,
      "end": 407.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma went forth, and also Amulek, among the people, to declare the words of God unto them;",
      "verse": "8:30",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 407.634,
      "end": 410.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were filled with the Holy Ghost.",
      "verse": "8:30",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 410.729,
      "end": 416.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they had power given unto them, insomuch that they could not be confined in dungeons;",
      "verse": "8:31",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 416.528,
      "end": 419.547,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither was it possible that any man could slay them;",
      "verse": "8:31",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 419.727,
      "end": 422.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they did not exercise their power",
      "verse": "8:31",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 422.926,
      "end": 426.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they were bound in bands and cast into prison.",
      "verse": "8:31",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 426.264,
      "end": 427.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, this was done",
      "verse": "8:31",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 428.162,
      "end": 431.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord might show forth his power in them.",
      "verse": "8:31",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 431.861,
      "end": 434.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they went forth",
      "verse": "8:32",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 434.595,
      "end": 441.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to preach and to prophesy unto the people, according to the spirit and power which the Lord had given them.",
      "verse": "8:32",
      "lineIndex": 122
    }
  ]
}